    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3015910/extras/f54ba475c7352bfd3abe40391f7d4929.avif?t=1732587105\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >iScoot is a multiplayer scooter sim. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features include:<br>- 10 unique open-world maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 10 custom scooters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- iScoot is a multiplayer game. Each level is a dedicated multiplayer server.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Realistic grinds with technical controls.<br><br>We recommend using a controller to play iScoot.</p>",
